# Aging-corner STA — emitted by phase3_one_shot_runner (TAPEOUT-SIGNOFF).
# Tool: OpenSTA (sta). This is a REAL STA run with an AGING set_timing_derate
# late=1.1000 applied BEYOND the fresh-silicon OCV, to model NBTI/PBTI/HCI
# transistor Vt-drift over lifetime. The worst-slack number below is tool-produced.
